    "text": "Champions League 2025 Fukuoka was held at Marine Messe Fukuoka on 15 and 16 February 2025. The top four of each league were invited to the 2025 World Championships. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Symbol in a print for their place, with the placing and the city in small text on the Champions League logo: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
